{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"852746408783904798","content":"\"Fair, I guess I could get behind the power of the natural world.\"","created_at":"2021-07-18T02:30:56.694000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"866144985312002068","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"852746408783904798","content":"\"Is that what gives you your shifting powers?\"","created_at":"2021-07-18T02:31:17.720000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"866145073501700106","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"harpy","id":"651981368175230976","is_bot":0,"username":"harpsy_cored"},"author_id":"651981368175230976","channel_id":"852746408783904798","content":"\"Yeah.\"","created_at":"2021-07-18T02:31:37.494000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"866145156439998464","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"852746408783904798","content":"\"Incredible!\"","created_at":"2021-07-18T02:32:19.223000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"866145331463979020","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"harpy","id":"651981368175230976","is_bot":0,"username":"harpsy_cored"},"author_id":"651981368175230976","channel_id":"852746408783904798","content":"\"I draw some of my strength from the moon. Its ever-changing nature gives many druids enhanced shifting power.\"","created_at":"2021-07-18T02:34:00.898000Z","edited_at":"2021-07-18T02:34:08.698000Z","id":"866145757920624660","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"852746408783904798","content":"\"Oh wow. I've heard those are the most powerful druids!\"","created_at":"2021-07-18T02:34:50.383000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"866145965474578482","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"harpy","id":"651981368175230976","is_bot":0,"username":"harpsy_cored"},"author_id":"651981368175230976","channel_id":"852746408783904798","content":"\"Well, they are druids with more shifting strength, others druids are more powerful with magic, or can even intertwine themselves with the spirit of nature itself.\"","created_at":"2021-07-18T02:36:14.529000Z","edited_at":"2021-07-18T02:36:25.612000Z","id":"866146318409531392","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"852746408783904798","content":"\"Interesting indeed\"","created_at":"2021-07-18T02:37:11.434000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"866146557086662677","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"harpy","id":"651981368175230976","is_bot":0,"username":"harpsy_cored"},"author_id":"651981368175230976","channel_id":"852746408783904798","content":"\"How about you? You seem to weave words very inspirationally.\"","created_at":"2021-07-18T02:37:52.778000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"866146730495442956","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"852746408783904798","content":"\"Over time I focused on the power of what my words really mean. Other bards focus on their performances and their music. I cared most about how people understand my meanings and what they do with it. I wanted to tell the truth and gain people's trust in order to inspire them. \"","created_at":"2021-07-18T02:39:52.026000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"866147230658068520","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"harpy","id":"651981368175230976","is_bot":0,"username":"harpsy_cored"},"author_id":"651981368175230976","channel_id":"852746408783904798","content":"\"Well, I hope you know, I trust you with my life, Finn.\"","created_at":"2021-07-18T02:40:29.713000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"866147388728541215","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"852746408783904798","content":"\"And I trust you with mine. But one thing. Don't let me living my life stop you from living yours. You focus in shifting yes? Do what you're good at and I'll be right behind you. You don't need to wait and react and make sure I'm okay, I'll be alright. And if not, I know you won't be far and others will be close to help me as well.\"","created_at":"2021-07-18T02:42:11.453000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"866147815457423420","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"852746408783904798","content":"\"I've been living free this way a long time, don't stress too much alright?\"\nHe chuckles after","created_at":"2021-07-18T02:42:36.199000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"866147919249670155","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
